OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering cloud in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast soon clearing. Then a day of
OL,7,Fsunny intervals and blustery showers,
OL,8,Fthese heavier and more frequent in the
OL,9,Fwest. Windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will continue to be a
OL,12,Fmixture of occasional showers, some
OL,13,Fheavy, along with a few clear
OL,14,Fintervals. Fresh to strong westerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FSaturday will be another day
OL,18,Fof frequent showers, heavy at times,
OL,19,Fand some sunny intervals. A windy day.
OL,20,FWinds and showers easing towards
OL,21,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
