OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells on Sunday then cloudier later
OL,7,Fwith patchy rain. Cloudy Monday with
OL,8,Fpatchy rain. Early rain clearing on
OL,9,FTuesday then sunshine and showers.
